{"Title":"An Act relative to distinctive registration plates for veterans’ spouses","BillNumber":"H3312","DocketNumber":"HD3141","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"CAF1","Name":"Carole A. Fiola","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CAF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-12T11:07:14.377"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"CAF1","Name":"Carole A. Fiola","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CAF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-12T11:07:14.3766667"},{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T16:42:29.4033333"},{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T09:05:56.1633333"},{"Id":"PAS1","Name":"Paul A. Schmid III","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PAS1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T14:43:55.8366667"},{"Id":"MJS3","Name":"Michael J. Soter","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJS3","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T10:42:01.3566667"},{"Id":"BET0","Name":"Bruce E. Tarr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BET0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-03T12:35:49.8766667"},{"Id":"BLW1","Name":"Bud L. Williams","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BLW1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:06:29.8266667"},{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2023-09-19T06:33:36.3033333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3312/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Fiola of Fall River, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3312) of Carole A. Fiola and others relative to distinctive registration plates for the spouses of veterans.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSection 2 of chapter 90 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2018 Official Edition, is hereby amended by deleting paragraph 16 and inserting the following:\r\n\tThe registrar shall furnish, upon application, to owners of private passenger motor vehicles and motorcycles who are veterans or a spouse of a veteran, as defined in clause Forty-third of section 7 of chapter 4 and upon presentation of evidence deemed satisfactory by the registrar, distinctive registration plates bearing on the left side the word \"VETERAN''. These plates shall also include a distinctive emblem or decal for those individuals who are a veteran spouse or those who have been awarded the Iraqi Freedom Campaign Ribbon or who served in Operation Enduring Freedom. There shall be an annual $20 fee for such \"VETERAN'' plates in addition to the established registration fee for private passenger motor vehicles and motorcycles. For the purposes of this paragraph, the word \"motorcycles'' shall not include motorized bicycles.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}